## Limitations and Workarounds

| Limitation | Workaround |
|-----------|-----------|
| Can't see real-time terminal output | Ask Claude to save output to file, then read it |
| Can't use interactive git rebase | Claude will manually handle merge conflicts |
| Can't test frontend changes visually | Ask for screenshots or run local server |
| Can't access private APIs | Provide API docs or example responses |

