## Troubleshooting

### Claude Can't Find a File
```
Solution: Use /read with the exact path or ask Claude to search first
```

### PR Creation Fails
```bash
# Check GitHub authentication
gh auth status

# Re-authenticate if needed
gh auth logout
gh auth login
```

### Changes Didn't Apply
```
Solution: Ask Claude to check git status and verify the changes
git status
git diff
```

